          "v": "hear"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " you clearly."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "你可以大声一点吗？我听不清楚。"
    },
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "— Billy lost his bike yesterday and had to walk home."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "— Oh, I’m sorry to "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "hear"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " that."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "——昨天比利的自行车丢了，他只好步行回家。\n——哦，听到这个消息我很抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "en": [
        {
